  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am Tom. Today we go to the park. We go on the bus. \"Bus\" is a Thai word too. Dad has a bag. Lily has a red kite. Pip has a ball. The sun is nice. I like the park.",
      "I kick the ball. \"Football is a Thai word too!\" says Lily. Pip runs. Lily plays with the kite. It is red and big. \"Is kite a Thai word?\" I ask. \"No,\" says Dad. \"Bus, football, and ball are Thai words.\"",
      "Now we sit and eat. Dad has rice and eggs. Lily has a drink. I have a drink too. \"Photo!\" says Dad. He takes a photo. Pip sits in the sun. Pip is happy. Dad is happy too. We smile. It is a good day."
    ],
    "summary": "Tom, Lily, Dad, and Pip spend a sunny day in the park. They find English words that Thai people say too, like bus, football, and ball.",
